---
title: Prebuilt capability reads
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Publish: index or render
    Publish --> Snapshot: atomic replacement
    Snapshot --> Read
    Read --> Validate: recorded metadata
    Validate --> Result: fresh
    Validate --> Stale: source changed
    Validate --> Unavailable: missing or corrupt
    Result --> [*]
    Stale --> [*]
    Unavailable --> [*]
    note right of Validate
      Reads never rebuild or scan
    end note
